note('lem-distributed-delay-midpoint-error-split','The distributed-delay lemma adds two upper bounds, for stored-history perturbation and exact-history quadrature, without an equivalence assertion.',choice='N:Proof1.1 expands at each specified quadrature midpoint and Proof2.1 compares the two fixed sums; no quadrature nodes are chosen by an existence argument.')
